{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured a three-member MariaDB Galera cluster. All members are active, enabled, Primary, Ready, Connected, and Synced at cluster size 3. Multi-member writes, single-member outage availability, automatic IST resynchronization, and persistence across sequential node reboots were verified.","actions_performed":["Installed MariaDB 10.11, Galera 4, and rsync on all nodes.","Applied node-specific Galera configuration and formed the three-member cluster.","Generated protected node-local probe credentials.","Verified writes through every member replicate to every other member.","Stopped node3, verified continued writes with two-member quorum, then confirmed automatic IST recovery.","Safely rebooted node1, node2, and node3 one at a time and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Three-member Galera cluster","command_ids":["cmd-46eb2fcbca674593","cmd-f4d6499650194bc8","cmd-d32e8eb5b7234505","cmd-d9950783cad942bb","cmd-000b5246fe8845f3","cmd-286d6d2667444ff6"],"summary":"Configuration identifies all three addresses; final direct checks show the same three-member incoming-address list and Primary/Synced size-3 state on every member."},{"requirement":"Writes through any member are available from other members","command_ids":["cmd-dfc5fcb627854ecf","cmd-d0ebd356e8a64d77","cmd-ac7f40e3718348ad","cmd-e850f28c2b0041e4","cmd-0d6ebf6615c349cb","cmd-dc90f7d1af274866"],"summary":"Each member accepted a distinct TCP write, and independent reads from all three returned every write marker."},{"requirement":"Database remains available when one member is unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-3f0fbaf7e5874dca","cmd-733df9bf285a46d3","cmd-86028091b1604168","cmd-660ff4f278eb4417","cmd-12f78816236f4ff6"],"summary":"With node3 inactive, node1 and node2 remained a Primary, Ready, Synced size-2 component; node2 accepted a write that node1 immediately read."},{"requirement":"Returning member automatically resynchronizes","command_ids":["cmd-3f0fbaf7e5874dca","cmd-660ff4f278eb4417","cmd-d62cdd56a9594e39","cmd-b2d02439ffde4bd1"],"summary":"After node3 returned, it contained the outage-time write and reported size 3/Synced; its journal records completed IST and synchronized readiness."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-512945f079e041a2","cmd-59ae439943e1445b","cmd-4f13179bc0474efa","cmd-2d36663add394b18"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered service, cluster membership, and data are directly demonstrated."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-09b1230546b1432c","cmd-2fb58bf6c1f64b10","cmd-fba4de831d604a4d","cmd-4dbdf17ec3e5402e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered service, cluster membership, and data are directly demonstrated."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node3 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-1340e5f13d5e4c8a","cmd-25501cd42e3f4911","cmd-faba4021b6b34202","cmd-7ae1d38044d44d21"],"summary":"Healthy baseline, reboot acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and recovered service, cluster membership, and data are directly demonstrated."},{"requirement":"Final health after all sequential restarts","command_ids":["cmd-d9950783cad942bb","cmd-000b5246fe8845f3","cmd-286d6d2667444ff6"],"summary":"Every node independently reports active/enabled MariaDB, Primary/Connected/Ready/Synced size 3, all three member addresses, and the identical five-row verification dataset."}]}
